sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin Service
    participant Kafka as foc.admin.events
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Admin->>Kafka: admin.case.resolved with faultParty
    Kafka->>Badges: orderId, caseId, faultParty
    alt other eventType or fails the schema
        Badges-->>Kafka: skip, and log when invalid
    else disputed_order already has a verdict
        Badges-->>Kafka: duplicate, the first verdict is kept
    else first verdict
        Badges->>DB: upsert disputed_order with faultParty and resolved_at
        alt escalation already seen, parties known
            Badges->>DB: count the order for whoever was not at fault
            Badges->>DB: adjust user_metrics and re-check those users
        else escalation not seen yet
            Note over Badges,DB: stored only, applied when ESCALATED arrives
        end
    end
